# A RHEL8 desktop's libraries and nothing to build with, to run the RHEL8
# build in (app/distro/smoke.sh): AlmaLinux 8 with the X libraries puritty
# links, fontconfig and a monospace font, and Xvfb to draw on.
#
#   podman build -t puritty-run-rhel8 app/distro/rhel8/run
FROM docker.io/library/almalinux:8
RUN dnf -y install libxcb xcb-util xcb-util-image xcb-util-renderutil libxkbcommon-x11 \
      fontconfig dejavu-sans-mono-fonts libpng zlib xorg-x11-server-Xvfb xkeyboard-config procps-ng \
 && dnf clean all
